<title>USA: Trans World Airlines Inc Q1 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Trans World Airlines Inc Q1 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.54     loss	 $1.46</p>
<p> Net loss		  71,564     loss	37,107</p>
<p> Revs		     762,306		  782,433</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 EPS include $0.03/shr one-time charge and is based on common and employee pfd shrs outstanding of 49.0 million.</p>
<p>1996 Q1 EPS include special dividend requirement of $0.48/shr for redemption of 12 pct pfd stock and is based on common and employee pfd shares outstanding of 41.8 million.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
